@baseUrl = http://localhost:5225
@token = cole-seu-jwt-aqui

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Listar vagas (filtros: technology, location, source, page, pageSize)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Jobs?technology=react&page=1&pageSize=20

### Detalhe de uma vaga
@jobId = cole-um-guid-de-vaga-aqui
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Jobs/{{jobId}}

### Fontes disponíveis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Jobs/sources

### Exportar CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Jobs/export?technology=python

### Registrar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Seu Nome", "email": "voce@exemplo.com", "password": "senha-com-letras-e-123" }

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "voce@exemplo.com", "password": "senha-com-letras-e-123" }

### Favoritos (requer JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sincronizar favoritos salvos no navegador (requer JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Favorites/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "jobIds": ["cole-guid-de-vaga-aqui"] }

### Criar alerta (requer JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "technology": "React", "location": "Remoto", "source": null }

### Sync manual (requer JWT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Jobs/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
